我正在教室⾥做作业，迈克进来了。
迈克曾在新华学校上学，现在转学到了我们班。
他学习成绩很好，但从来不写作业，还总借同学们的作业本。
迈克看见我，⾛过来坐在我旁边。
他从未借过我的作业本。
他⼀坐下，我就向他借他的作业本。
让我惊讶的是，他马上就给了我。迈克说:“我还从未向你借过作业本，你现在就替我把作业做了吧！”
I was doing my homework in the classroom when Mike came in.
Mike studied in the Xinhua school, but now he is in our class.
He is a good student, but he never does his homework and always borrows his classmates' workbooks. 
Mike saw me and came and sat next to me. He has never borrowed my workbook.
When he sat down, I asked him to lend me his workbook. 
To my surprise, he gave it to me immediately. 
Mike said, "I've never borrowed a workbook from you, so now you can do the homework for me!"
